variable C43 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C43 equal 0.5*(41.9614081734906+${C4pos})
variable C43 equal 0.5*(41.9614081734906+-41.9219836644103)
variable C5${dir} equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C53 equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C53 equal 0.5*(-43.3670396217302+${C5pos})
variable C53 equal 0.5*(-43.3670396217302+43.3205414290406)
